==Battleground==
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Aku Cyclone]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Devil Wife]] spawns.
**1 [[Deathshund]] spawns.
**15 [[Zigge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**5 [[Devil Wife|Devil Wives]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
**1 [[Dread Bore]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
**20 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
You want the Deathshund gone as soon as possible. Lure it near your base, then burst it with [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] nukers like [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]]. By now you should have a high-level [[Cat Cannon#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]], so it is advised to bring a Cat Cannon Recharge (M) or (L) [[Cat Combo]] to continuously Holy Blast Deathshund and remove big chunks of its health. Once Deathshund dies for good, you've basically won. Dread Bore shouldn't be much of an issue, as [[:Category:Crowd-Controller-class Cats|crowd-controllers]] like [[Talents|Talented]] [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] or [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Weedwacker Cat]] can keep it at bay while your anti-Zombie nukers whittle it down along with the help of your Holy Blast. Once Dread Bore dies too, use [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]] and [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]] like [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Cat Researcher]] and [[Ancient Egg: N109 (Rare Cat)|Barrel Cat]] to defeat Aku Cyclone and win.

==Trivia==
